  "notes": "USAGE:\nAs a noun, {合成|ごうせい} often modifies other nouns to mean \"synthetic\" or \"composite\": {合成|ごうせい}{樹脂|じゅし} (synthetic resin), {合成|ごうせい}{着色料|ちゃくしょくりょう} (synthetic coloring). As a する verb, it means to synthesize or composite.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {合成|ごうせい}{写真|しゃしん}: composite photograph\n- {合成|ごうせい}{繊維|せんい}: synthetic fiber\n- {音声|おんせい}{合成|ごうせい}: speech synthesis\n- {化学|かがく}{合成|ごうせい}: chemical synthesis\n- {合成|ごうせい}{着色料|ちゃくしょくりょう}: artificial coloring",
